---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { u } from '../../../lib/paths';
---

<Base title="Reset a UM password" description="How to reset a University of Mars account password and what to do if the UM email inbox is unavailable.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="IT & accounts"
    title="Reset a UM password"
    lede="MyUM, email, and the campus Wi-Fi use the same password."
    crumbs={[
      { href: '/support/', label: 'Student Support' },
      { href: '/support/articles/password/', label: 'Password' },
    ]}
  />
  <article class="prose wrap narrow">
    <ol>
      <li>On the MyUM sign-in page, choose “Forgot password”.</li>
      <li>Enter your UM email, the address that ends in @umars.edu.</li>
      <li>Open the message from accounts@umars.edu and set a new password. The link expires in 30 minutes.</li>
      <li>Sign out of other browsers if you think someone else used the account.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      If you cannot open the inbox, submit a request under IT &amp; accounts and add a phone number in the description.
      The desk will not reset a password from a non-UM email alone.
    </p>
    <p>Wi-Fi name: UM-Secure. Use the same email and the new password. Guest Wi-Fi is only for visitors.</p>
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={u('/support/?category=it#request')}>Get help with an account</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
